dul:Organization a owl:Class .
top:Parameter a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass dul:Parameter .
dul:Parameter a owl:Class .
top:Person a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass dul:Person .
dul:Person a owl:Class .
top:PhysicalObject a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass dul:PhysicalObject .
dul:PhysicalObject a owl:Class .
top:Quality a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass dul:Quality .
dul:Quality a owl:Class .
top:Region a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass dul:Region .
dul:Region a owl:Class .
top:Role a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass dul:Role .
dul:Role a owl:Class .
top:Situation a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass dul:Situation .
dul:Situation a owl:Class .
top:SocialObject a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass dul:SocialObject .
