top:Workflow a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass dul:Workflow .
dul:Workflow a owl:Class .
top:WorkflowExecution a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass dul:WorkflowExecution .
dul:WorkflowExecution a owl:Class .

